{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/student-loans-a-guide-to-terms-and-conditions","content_id":"2d372311-8f87-4684-a361-477bb459b109","description":"A guide describing terms and conditions for students taking out a student loan in academic years 2026 to 2027 and 2025 to 2026.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9479979","isbn":"","title":"Student loans: a guide to terms and conditions 2026 to 2027","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/student-loans-a-guide-to-terms-and-conditions/student-loans-a-guide-to-terms-and-conditions-2026-to-2027"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9479980","isbn":"","title":"Student loans: a guide to terms and conditions 2025 to 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/student-loans-a-guide-to-terms-and-conditions/student-loans-a-guide-to-terms-and-conditions-2025-to-2026"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Before applying for student finance, it’s important that you understand the terms and conditions of your loan. Our guide will help you understand your loan contract, your repayment plan type, how you’ll repay your loan and how to contact us if you’re not satisfied.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Update to repayment thresholds for 2026 to 2027.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:01:06Z"},{"note":"Updated for new academic year","public_timestamp":"2026-01-19T10:36:16Z"},{"note":" - section 5.2 has been updated to make it clearer that you repay 9% of your income over the Plan 2 repayment threshold\r\n\r\n - section 5.5 has been updated to advise that you can request a below threshold refund via your repayment account\r\n\r\n\r\n - section 6.13 has been updated to advise how to request a credit balance refund or below threshold refund\r\n\r\n - section 8 has been updated with a link to the Student Loan Company contact details page","public_timestamp":"2025-07-16T08:14:53Z"},{"note":"Updated for 25/26 thresholds","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:30:07Z"},{"note":"2025 to 2026 terms and conditions have been added","public_timestamp":"2025-02-11T15:35:50Z"},{"note":"Removed 2022 to 2023 and updated 2024 to 2025 guide to terms and conditions.","public_timestamp":"2024-04-06T09:00:08Z"},{"note":"Terms and conditions have been added for 2024 to 2025","public_timestamp":"2024-01-26T14:08:46Z"},{"note":"Updated Student Loans Company address from 100 Bothwell Street, Glasgow, G2 7JD to 10 Clyde Place, Glasgow, G5 8DF","public_timestamp":"2023-12-04T10:27:10Z"},{"note":"The 2023/24 guide has been updated with new repayment threshold information.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-06T08:00:03Z"},{"note":"A guide to terms and conditions for the 2023/24 academic year have been added","public_timestamp":"2023-01-17T16:38:17Z"},{"note":"Updated HTML for academic year 2022 to 2023 to reference and include guidance for Higher Education Short Course Loans content.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-25T11:41:25Z"},{"note":"Updated HMTL Terms and Conditions for 2021 to 2022 and 2022 to 2023, to highlight acronyms.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-07T11:45:25Z"},{"note":"Updates have been made to the repayment thresholds in the 2022 to 2023 Terms and Conditions Guide","public_timestamp":"2022-04-05T23:30:04Z"},{"note":"Added guide for terms and conditions 2022 to 2023.","public_timestamp":"2022-01-17T09:12:22Z"},{"note":"Additional amendment to section 5.7 interest rates. ","public_timestamp":"2021-07-01T10:23:41Z"},{"note":"Adjustments made to interest rates in sections; 4.1, 5.7 and 6.12. ","public_timestamp":"2021-07-01T09:26:33Z"},{"note":"Converted the PDF document to a HTML. ","public_timestamp":"2021-06-28T09:11:41Z"},{"note":"Added updated terms and conditions guide for new tax year.","public_timestamp":"2021-04-06T